msgstr "Du har valgt at sende denne meddelelse til over 200 brugere. Tjek venligst grænsen for afsendelse af e-mail hos din vært, før du sender."

#: includes/admin/class-bnfw-notification.php:600
msgid "Choose the users and/or user roles to send this email notification to."
msgstr "Vælg de brugere og/eller brugerroller, som denne mail skal sendes til."

#: includes/admin/class-bnfw-notification.php:584
msgid "E.g. If you're an editor and regularly update your posts, you might not want to be emailed about this all the time. Ticking this box will prevent you from receiving emails about your own changes."
msgstr "F.eks. Hvis du er redaktør og regelmæssigt opdaterer dine indlæg, ønsker du måske ikke at blive sendt via e-mail om dette hele tiden. Hvis du markerer dette felt, forhindres du i at modtage e-mails om dine egne ændringer."

#: includes/admin/class-bnfw-notification.php:566
msgid "Send to Author"
msgstr "Send til forfatter"

#: includes/admin/class-bnfw-notification.php:551
msgid "Privately copy in any other users or user roles to this email."
msgstr "Kopier privat i andre brugere eller brugerroller til denne e-mail."

#: includes/admin/class-bnfw-notification.php:537
msgid "Publicly copy in any other users or user roles to this email."
msgstr "Kopier offentligt i andre brugere eller brugerroller til denne e-mail."

#: includes/admin/class-bnfw-notification.php:524
msgid "If you want any replies to your email notification to go to another person, fill in this box with their name and email address."
msgstr "Hvis du ønsker, at svar på din e-mail-meddelelse skal gå til en anden person, skal du udfylde dette felt med vedkommendes navn og e-mail-adresse."

#: includes/admin/class-bnfw-notification.php:510
msgid "If you want to send the email from your site name and email address instead of the default \"WordPress\" from \"wordpress@domain.com\", this is where you can do it."
msgstr "Hvis du vil sende e-mailen fra dit websteds navn og e-mail-adresse i stedet for standard \"WordPress\" fra \"wordpress@domain.com\", er det her du kan gøre det."

#: includes/admin/class-bnfw-notification.php:497
msgid "This should be fairly self explanatory but if you're unsure, tick this checkbox and have a look at the available options. You can always untick it again should you decide you don't need to use it."
msgstr "Dette bør være temmelig selvforklarende, men hvis du er usikker, skal du markere dette afkrydsningsfelt og se på de tilgængelige muligheder. Du kan altid fjerne det igen, hvis du beslutter dig for, at du ikke behøver at bruge det."

#: includes/admin/class-bnfw-notification.php:475
msgid "How do you want to format the sent email? HTML is recommended as it'll show images and links correctly."
msgstr "Hvordan vil du formatere den sendte e-mail? HTML anbefales, da det vil vise billeder og links korrekt."

